  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\int_0^n[x] d x=\\int_0^1 0 d x+\\int_1^2 1 d x+\\int_2^3 2 d x+\\ldots \\ldots+ \\\\\n& \\int_{n-1}^n(n-1) d x \\\\\n& =1+2+3+\\ldots .+(n-1)=\\frac{(n-1) n}{2}=66 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow n(n-1)=132 \\Rightarrow n=12\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
